This Colab notebook trains a ResNet50 embedding model for image-to-image product search on the Midnight Divas dataset from Google Drive. It evaluates with Recall@K and mAP@5, builds a FAISS index, and saves artifacts to Drive.

- Input: dataset organized as `category/product/images` (e.g., `swimwear/product1/img1.jpg`).
- Optional: clothing-only crops using a DeepFashion2 detector; falls back to full image.
- Output: trained weights (`.pth`), label mapping, FAISS index data, and a top-5 retrieval demo.

